flowchart TB
    classDef input fill:#eff6ff,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#172554
    classDef rule fill:#ecfdf5,stroke:#047857,color:#064e3b
    classDef result fill:#f5f3ff,stroke:#6d28d9,color:#2e1065

    Event[Incoming event]:::input
    Mode{Configured evaluation mode}:::input

    subgraph First[first_match: stop at first matching rule]
        F1[Rule A: priority 100]:::rule
        F1Match{Matches?}:::rule
        F2[Rule B: priority 50]:::rule
        F2Match{Matches?}:::rule
        FDefault[Otherwise rule: lowest priority]:::rule
        FResult[Emit effects from one rule]:::result
        F1 --> F1Match
        F1Match -->|Yes| FResult
        F1Match -->|No| F2 --> F2Match
        F2Match -->|Yes| FResult
        F2Match -->|No| FDefault --> FResult
    end

    subgraph All[all_matches: collect every matching rule]
        A1[Rule A: priority 100]:::rule
        A2[Rule B: priority 50]:::rule
        A3[Rule C: priority 10]:::rule
        AResult[Collect effects from all matches]:::result
        A1 --> A2 --> A3 --> AResult
    end

    Event --> Mode
    Mode -->|first_match| F1
    Mode -->|all_matches| A1
    Note[Rules are evaluated deterministically against the same event.<br/>The evaluator has no database, clock, or network access.]:::input
